    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d255">

                <pb facs="0724" n="602" xml:id="pg602"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Ryan to Mr.
                            Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-07-22"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 22, 1889</date>.
                        (Received August 1.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 48.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Pursuant to your instruction No. 30, of
                    12th instant, I have the honor to advise you that I this day addressed to Mr.
                    Mariscal a note upon the subject of the claim of Howard C. Walker against the
                    Mexican Government for wrongful imprisonment and cruel treatment at Minatitlan,
                    State of Vera Cruz, copy of said note being herewith inclosed.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thos. Ryan.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d255-a1.xml" xpointer="d255-a1"/>
